~ start
Villager: Oh! A traveler… You startled me.
- Sorry. I didn’t mean to. => greeting_2
- I’m just passing through. => greeting_2

~ greeting_2
Villager: No harm done. Not many choose this road anymore. Dangerous times.
- Have you seen anyone else around? => info_1
- What is this place? => info_2

~ info_1
Villager: A few… but most don’t return. Monsters roam freely after sunset.
- I can handle myself. => recognition_trigger

~ info_2
Villager: A forgotten village. Best left forgotten.
- You seem nervous. => recognition_trigger

~ recognition_trigger
Villager (suspicious): Wait…
- What is it? => recognition_1

~ recognition_1
Villager (fear): That armor… I’ve seen it before.
- I don’t know what you mean. => recognition_2

~ recognition_2
Villager (hostile): You’re one of *them*.
- Them? => hostile_1

~ hostile_1
Villager (angry): You bring ruin wherever you walk. I won’t let it happen again!
do GameState.request_attack.emit()
- [Attack]
- [Defend yourself]
do GameState.player_attack_villager.emit()
Villager: [wait=1] Gwah! Stay back!
- Why did you attack me? => lore_start
- Who are you? => lore_start

~ lore_start
Villager (nervous): Please… spare me! I only attacked to defend myself. That armor you wear… You are from the Order of the Black Crescent?
- Never heard of them. The Black Crescent? => lore_1
- Not and I don’t care about orders. => lore_1

~ lore_1
Villager (hesitant): They are a notorious group of knights, feared across these lands. They enforce rules that no one dares challenge. Those who resist… rarely survive.
- Why are they so feared? => lore_2
- What do you mean “rules”? => lore_2

~ lore_2
Villager (grim): The Black Crescent controls the roads, the villages, even the forests. Travelers are taxed, villagers obey, and anyone wearing that armor is recognized immediately.
- So that’s why you attacked me. => lore_3
- What happened to those who resisted? => lore_3

~ lore_3
Villager (anxious): Many… disappeared, taken by the knights or their enforcers. They even killed my brother when he tried to protect our village. It is a dangerous world, traveler.
- Monsters? => lore_4
- I see… tell me more. => lore_4

~ lore_4
Villager (reluctant): The “monsters” are not beasts in the usual sense. They are creations of the Black Crescent—guards, beasts, or enchanted soldiers. Anyone who challenges the order is hunted.
- How do villagers survive? => lore_5
- I need to get through safely. => lore_5

~ lore_5
Villager (thinking): Villagers hide, flee, or obey. Some brave souls resist in secret. If you wear that armor, you are immediately recognized, and danger follows you everywhere.
- Understood. => continue_journey
- I have more questions. => questions_start

~ questions_start
Villager (reluctant): Ask quickly… I don’t have much time.
- Who are the Black Crescent exactly? => questions_org
- What are these rules they enforce? => questions_rules
- How do people survive the monsters? => questions_monsters

~ questions_org
Villager (grim): The Black Crescent is an order of elite knights and enforcers. They claim loyalty to the crown, but in truth they act for themselves.
- I see. => questions_start
- Continue. => questions_start

~ questions_rules
Villager (stern): Their rules are simple: obey, pay tribute, or be hunted. Roads, villages, forests… all fall under their control.
- Got it. => questions_start
- Continue. => questions_start

~ questions_monsters
Villager (worried): People survive by hiding, fleeing at night, or bribing patrols. Some strong fighters resist, but they are few.
- Okay. => continue_journey
- Enough for now. => continue_journey

~ continue_journey
Villager: Be careful. With that armor, the world watches you, and danger is never far.  
=> END